        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="callout">
        <strong>Architectural specification: the move.</strong>
        <ul>
            <li>Your loop removed an item from the list it was traversing. Did your loop survive that — and if it was a forward loop over an index, which card did it skip? What is the fix, and is your case even affected?</li>
