            <li>Nothing reads <code>damage</code>, <code>cost</code> or <code>health</code> yet — they go from the asset into a text label. Your rule is the first thing in the project that reads one of them as a NUMBER. Which one, and what does that make your AI's rule responsible for that the text labels were not?</li>
